    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可恶～！\n又被捆起来了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF6076FF5EFF01000A53C888AB63468D7767654E86FF0100100002011400040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "快来人帮我松绑啊～！！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n用宝可梦的强劲招式\n狠狠地破坏这团丝就行！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FEB67654EBA5E2E6211677E7ED1554AFF5EFF01FF0100100001BE01000A75285B9D53EF68A676845F3A52B262DB5F0F000A72E072E057307834574F8FD956E24E1D5C31884CFF0100100002011400040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有人被宝可梦的丝\n缠成了一团……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n用威力强劲的宝可梦招式\n破坏这团丝，救出那个人吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094EBA88AB5B9D53EF68A676844E1D000A7F2062104E864E0056E22026202600100001BE01000A75285A01529B5F3A52B276845B9D53EF68A662DB5F0F000A7834574F8FD956E24E1DFF0C655151FA90A34E2A4EBA542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托你用威力更高的招式！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要确认招式有多强的话，\n就打开菜单选择宝可梦，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n再执行“选择可使用的招式”。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584F6075285A01529B66F49AD8768462DB5F0FFF0100100001BE01000A8981786E8BA462DB5F0F6709591A5F3A76848BDDFF0C000A5C3162535F0083DC5355900962E95B9D53EF68A6FF0C00100001BE00000A518D6267884C201C900962E953EF4F7F7528768462DB5F0F201D300200100002011400040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呼～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "547CFF5EFF01001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总算是脱身了！！\n谢谢！你帮大忙了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B7B97662F81318EAB4E86FF01FF01000A8C228C22FF014F605E2E59275FD94E86FF01001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "发生什么事了？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53D1751F4EC04E484E8B4E86FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是谁干的？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8C015E727684FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是圆丝蛛它们把我捆成这样的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F57064E1D86DB5B834EEC628A6211634662108FD9683776843002001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉，其实它们是我的搭档，\n圆丝蛛三兄弟。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5509FF0C51765B9E5B834EEC662F62117684642D6863FF0C000A57064E1D86DB4E0951445F1F3002001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它们生气的时候\n总～是会把我用丝捆起来……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834EEC751F6C14768465F65019000A603BFF5E662F4F1A628A621175284E1D63468D77676520262026001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卷嘶卷嘶！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5377563653775636FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "刚才我一不小心\n把它们筑好的巢弄坏了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "521A624D62114E004E0D5C0F5FC3000A628A5B834EEC7B51597D76845DE25F04574F4E86FF01001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是就被它们3只联合起来吐丝捆住，\n我又不是故意的，原谅我就好了嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F5C3188AB5B834EEC003353EA805454088D77676554104E1D63464F4FFF0C000A621153C84E0D662F6545610F7684FF0C539F8C0562115C31597D4E86561B3002001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "卷嘶卷嘶！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5377563653775636FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "知道了！知道了！\n我会好好反省的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "77E590534E86FF0177E590534E86FF01000A62114F1A597D597D53CD77017684FF01001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，既然你们能吐出这么多丝，\n干脆做成网或者绳子来卖吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C65E271364F604EEC80FD541051FA8FD94E48591A4E1DFF0C000A5E728106505A62107F51621680057EF35B50676553565427FF01001000020114016D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……呃，\n我是瞎说的！圆丝蛛三兄弟！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
